+## Editorial terms
+
+The **house language** is the default locale assigned to a post. Its **backup
+edition** is the translation in that locale. If none of the reader’s preferences
+match exactly or by language, see [what appears at fallback](#unmatched-preferences).
+
+## Matching preferences
+
+Use the first exact match in the preference list from the browser's
+`Accept-Language` header. If no locale matches
+exactly, use the first language-only match.
+
 ## Unmatched preferences
 
 When no requested locale matches exactly or by language, show the translation
